  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Constructing a better Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the programme is to contribute towards the consolidation of peace, harmony and democratic values in Mozambique, with an active and responsible presence and ethical Christian values, in order to overcome the fragile social, economic and environmental issues plagued by the country. The Catholic Church in Mozambique has had a dominant role to play in nation building from the troubled days of civil war and the role is still crucial in many ways specially to restore peace and justice to every citizen of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
